            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge eine Zeile zum Konstruktor hinzu, die die Variable <code>is_playing</code> auf <code>False</code> setzt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Song\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, artist)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.artist = artist\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.is_playing = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>self</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>is_playing</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>False</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
